WEBVTT

00:09:58.552 --> 00:10:01.889
We will be able to cross
the digital divide,

00:10:01.889 --> 00:10:03.390
and we will have more jobs,

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:06.810
and we will all get that great
“Yes! I fixed it!” feeling.

00:10:07.311 --> 00:10:10.731
So the next time
something around you breaks,

00:10:10.773 --> 00:10:13.609
don't take "broken" for an answer.

00:10:13.651 --> 00:10:14.943
Go fix something.

00:10:15.819 --> 00:10:17.863
(Applause)

00:10:17.905 --> 00:10:19.031
Thank you.